"Exceptions from :class:`~scrapy.loader.ItemLoader` :ref:`input and output "
"processors <topics-loaders-processors>` are now more verbose (:gh:`3836`, :"
"gh:`3840`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/1.x.rst:533
msgid ""
