msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/1.x.rst:576
msgid ""
"A new topic, :ref:`topics-dynamic-content`, covers recommended approaches to "
"read dynamically-loaded data (:gh:`3703`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/1.x.rst:579
msgid ""
":ref:`topics-broad-crawls` now features information about memory usage (:gh:"
