#: ../../../news/1.x.rst:1736
msgid ""
"Download handlers are now lazy-loaded on first request using their scheme (:"
"gh:`1390`, :gh:`1421`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/1.x.rst:1738
msgid ""
"HTTPS download handlers do not force TLS 1.0 anymore; instead, OpenSSL's "
"``SSLv23_method()/TLS_method()`` is used allowing to try negotiating with "
"the remote hosts the highest TLS protocol version it can (:gh:`1794`, :gh:"
"`1629`)."
